1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:08,150
In hospitals across Mexico, patients tell stories of a mysterious nurse who appears at night… but doesn't belong to the living.

2
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:15,240
They call her La Planchada. She wears an old-fashioned white uniform, perfectly ironed, without a single wrinkle.

3
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:21,600
According to legend, she was once a dedicated nurse who fell deeply in love with a doctor who betrayed her.

4
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:29,750
Some versions say she died heartbroken. Others claim she neglected her patients before dying, leaving her spirit unable to rest.

5
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:36,610
Patients have claimed a strange nurse appeared beside their beds, checked their medicine, and comforted them through the night.

6
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:43,020
But when those patients thanked the hospital staff the next morning, nobody recognized the nurse they described.

7
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:50,360
According to the stories, some patients later discovered that the woman who cared for them had supposedly died years earlier.

8
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:59,225
And here's the chilling legend: La Planchada doesn't haunt hospitals to hurt people. She returns because she never stopped caring for her patients.
